# Shared JetBrains plugins, installed into every IDE by tooling/jetbrains/apply-plugins
# via the headless `installPlugins` launcher command. One canonical Marketplace
# plugin ID per line; JARs are fetched at apply time, never vendored. Only portable,
# non-language-locked plugins belong here (PHP/Terraform/etc. stay per-IDE).
org.sylfra.idea.plugins.linessorter
mobi.hsz.idea.gitignore
ru.adelf.idea.dotenv
# Vim. IdeaVIM reads ~/.ideavimrc (a chezmoi seed, see tooling/data/dotfiles.manifest);
# the other three are required by mappings in that file. de.netnexus.camelcaseplugin
# was dropped here: vim-abolish's cr* coercions replace it in both editors.
IdeaVIM
eu.theblob42.idea.whichkey
org.yelog.ideavim.flash
com.magidc.ideavim.dial
